{"t":"DG","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Dollar General Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","employees":194000,"hq":"Goodlettsville, TN, United States","website":"https://www.dollargeneral.com","summary_en":"Dollar General Corporation, a discount retailer, provides various merchandise products in the southern, southwestern, midwestern, and eastern United States. It offers consumable products, including paper towels, bath tissues, paper dinnerware, trash and storage bags, disinfectants, and laundry products; packaged food, such as cereals, pasta, canned soups, canned meats, fruits and vegetables, condiments, spices, sugar, and flour; and perishables, including milk, eggs, bread, refrigerated and frozen food, beer, wine, and produce; candy, cookies, crackers, salty snacks, and carbonated beverages; over-the-counter medicines and personal care products including soap, body wash, shampoo, cosmetics, dental hygiene and foot care products; pet supplies and pet food; and tobacco products. The company also provides seasonal products comprising holiday items, toys, batteries, small electronics, greeting cards, stationery, prepaid phones and accessories, gardening supplies, hardware, automotive, and home office supplies; home products include kitchen supplies, cookware, small appliances, light bulbs, storage containers, frames, candles, craft supplies and kitchen, and bed and bath soft goods; and apparel products for infants, toddlers, girls, boys, women and men, as well as socks, underwear, disposable diapers, shoes and accessories. The company was formerly known as J.L. Turner & Son, Inc. and changed its name to Dollar General Corporation in 1968. Dollar General Corporation was founded in 1939 and is based in Goodlettsville, Tennessee.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"할인 소매업체인 Dollar General Corporation은 미국 남부, 남서부, 중서부 및 동부에 다양한 상품을 제공합니다. 종이 타월, 목욕 티슈, 종이 식기류, 쓰레기 및 보관 봉투, 소독제, 세탁 제품을 포함한 소모품을 제공합니다. 시리얼, 파스타, 수프 통조림, 고기 통조림, 과일 및 채소, 조미료, 향신료, 설탕 및 밀가루와 같은 포장 식품; 우유, 달걀, 빵, 냉장 및 냉동 식품, 맥주, 와인, 농산물 등 부패하기 쉬운 식품; 사탕, 쿠키, 크래커, 짠 스낵, 탄산음료; 비누, 바디 워시, 샴푸, 화장품, 치과 위생 및 발 관리 제품을 포함한 일반 의약품 및 개인 관리 제품; 애완동물 용품 및 애완동물 사료; 그리고 담배 제품. 또한 이 회사는 명절 용품, 장난감, 배터리, 소형 전자제품, 축하 카드, 문구류, 선불 전화기 및 액세서리, 원예 용품, 하드웨어, 자동차 및 홈 오피스 용품으로 구성된 계절별 제품을 제공합니다. 가정용품에는 주방용품, 조리기구, 소형 가전제품, 전구, 보관 용기, 액자, 양초, 공예품 및 주방용품, 침대 및 욕실용품이 포함됩니다. 영유아, 여아, 남아, 여성, 남성을 위한 의류 제품과 양말, 속옷, 일회용 기저귀, 신발, 액세서리 등을 취급합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 J.L. Turner & Son, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 1968년에 이름을 Dollar General Corporation으로 변경했습니다. Dollar General Corporation은 1939년에 설립되었으며 테네시 주 Goodlettsville에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":138.0,"mcap":30445115392.0,"pe":17.92208,"fpe":16.596012,"peg":1.7701,"ps":0.69767445,"pb":3.277676,"ev_ebitda":12.459,"div":1.71,"beta":0.191,"hi52":158.23,"lo52":95.11},"fin":{"rev":43637997568.0,"rev_g":0.052,"eps_g":0.333,"gross":0.31160998,"op":0.06813,"net":0.03903,"roe":0.19692,"fcf":1738019712.0,"cash":1589590016.0,"debt":15773100032.0,"de":169.811,"eps":7.7,"feps":8.31525},"own":{"short":0.0304,"inst":1.00957,"insider":0.0028},"analyst":{"n":29,"mean":141.51724,"median":140.0,"high":178.0,"low":90.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.32258,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":17,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":18,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":19,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-06","Firm":"Gordon Haskett","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":140.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-24","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":160.0,"priorPriceTarget":125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-08","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":151.0,"priorPriceTarget"